# incident-console build context guard (Phase 5 env plan, G5).
# Dockerfile does COPY . . with this directory as the build context, so
# anything not excluded here would be baked into the VM image - including a
# stray .env.local carrying the live Supabase DSN / R2 keys (which
# config.py loads with override=True, so it would also silently win inside
# the container). Never ship real values; the VM deploy injects them via
# compose `environment:` interpolation from generated.env.* instead.
.env.local
.env
*.env_file
generated.env*
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
